---
import {site} from '../data/site';
interface Props {subject?:string;}
const {subject='Market making enquiry'}=Astro.props;
const enquiryBody='Token / project:\nWebsite:\nExchanges or pools:\nCurrent liquidity challenge:\nIndicative capital range (optional):\nTiming:\n';
---
<section id="contact" class="home-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div><p>Start with a free market assessment.</p><h2 id="contact-title">What does your<br/>market need?</h2></div><div class="contact-copy"><p>Share your project, venues or pools, and what you want to improve. We assess your project, market and liquidity, then provide a proposal and quote. The assessment and proposal are free, with no obligation.</p><a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(enquiryBody)}`}>{site.email}</a><p class="contact-audience">Opens an email with a short briefing template.<br/>No account access needed to enquire.</p><a class="contact-next" href="/work#commercials">Understand the engagement model</a></div></section>
